{"v":3,"catch":"免費的起司只會出現在捕鼠器裡 —— 但誰能忍住不去拿呢！","desc":"《Jump, Mouse, Jump!》是一款節奏明快的縱向平台動作遊戲，你的唯一目標就是盡可能往更高處攀登！\n\n化身為勇敢的小老鼠，在平台之間跳躍，同時收集起司並閃避那些想阻止你往上爬的飢餓貓咪。\n\n上手容易，但精通困難 —— 每一次跳躍都至關重要，每一個平台都可能致命，一個錯誤就可能讓你從高處墜落！你爬得越高，分數越高，刺激感也越強！\n\n你有本事挑戰新的高度嗎？","publisher":"Soroka Games","release":"2026-02-12","genres":["街機","動作","其他"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"普遍級","size":"Switch 2 0.2GB / Switch 0.2GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/56b4649c43473199404ccfc5c6561f2c403d01b9fe1a2f52c5c4a59e3e2c817a.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/efa9364891f1428c517d00eed7d3c2621d4e4884e5653352d523e26cb379c7b1.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/0e2e5b21c480a3e5808e1e4e44ff55de4c48f201de137aca2514b3b1ac02b854.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/1d002b495e573ad4ed071dde305fdcc8c9c6545527da4841aeeb24880ca17fe0.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/cbee7e8231eda840f1a82eaaa3eb90db531474f6f7fd2f6a71fe4389f51c4ddb.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/7706230e68e3efa54c1dac9af8c601f73743aa9a3bfb6a6b80623037d1fb69e8.jpg"],"titleId":"0100c31026a94000","dlc":[]}